# The Microkernel's PCI configuration access on Bandit 1's own ports instead
# of PC configuration mechanism #1 ($CF8/$CFC), which no Mac has.
#
# - grow-segment takes most of the zero padding between .rodata and .got into
#   the loaded text: the kernel's code cave (src/kernel-cave.h, which also
#   says why it stops short of .got).
# - kernel-bat1.S maps Bandit 1 and Grand Central through the BAT the 604
#   kernel leaves unused, and keeps the kernel's VM map below that window.
# - kernel-pci.c replaces the eight pci_* accessors.
file /MK/MK_TEST.PPC
grow-segment 0 0x6ED00
asm src/kernel-bat1.S 4e8d34a5501b
asm src/kernel-pci.c 3e4fe82cb985
